quotes.text:
Election disinformation and misinformation remain a danger to our democracy.

@SenAlexPadilla and I are pressing the largest social media companies on their efforts to combat the spread of fraudulent material online seeking to disenfranchise U.S. voters

With the Trump admin’s actions to sow distrust in the upcoming elections, and artificial intelligence creating opportunities to spread false information at lightning speed – we need an all-hands approach to protect the right to vote.
